12.TRIBONACCI NUMBER 
You are given a number n. Your task is to find n-th Tribonacci Number Tn.
Tribonacci Number:  T0 = 0, T1 = 1, T2 = 1, and Tn+3 = Tn + Tn+1 + Tn+2 for n >= 0.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public static int nthTribonacci(int n) {
                if(n==0){
                    return 0;
                }
                if(n==1 || n==2){
                    return 1;
                }
                int t0=0,t1=1,t2=1;
                for(int i=3;i<=n;i++){
                    int t3=t0+t1+t2;
                    t0=t1;
                    t1=t2;
                    t2=t3;
                }
                return t2;
            }
        }
