17.DIGITS IN FACTORIAL 
Given an integer n, find the number of digits in the value of n factorial. 
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public int digitsInFactorial(int n) {
                if(n==0 || n==1){
                    return 1;
                }
                double fact=0;
                for(int i=1;i<=n;i++){
                    fact+=Math.log10(i);
                }
                return (int) fact+1;
            }
        }
